#: main.c:128
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Usage: rox [OPTION]... [FILE]...\n"
"Rox-Filer2 opens each directory or file listed, or the current working\n"
"directory if no arguments are given.\n"
"\n"
"Desktop:\n"
"      --desktop\tstart the single Rox-Filer2 Desktop instance\n"
"\n"
"File manager:\n"
"  -c, --client-id=ID\tused for session management\n"
"  -d, --dir=DIR\t\topen DIR as directory (not application)\n"
"  -D, --close=DIR\tclose DIR and its subdirectories\n"
"  -h, --help\t\tdisplay this help and exit\n"
"  -m, --mime-type=FILE\tprint MIME type of FILE and exit\n"
"  -n, --new\t\tstart a separate filer instance\n"
"  -R, --RPC\t\tinvoke method call read from stdin\n"
"  -s, --show=FILE\topen a directory showing FILE\n"
"  -u, --user\t\tshow user name in each window\n"
"  -U, --url=URL\t\topen file or directory in URI form\n"
"  -v, --version\t\tdisplay version information and exit\n"
"  -x, --examine=FILE\tFILE has changed - re-examine it\n"
"\n"
"Legacy ROX panel compatibility:\n"
"  -b, --border=PANEL\topen PANEL as a border panel\n"
"  -B, --bottom=PANEL\topen PANEL as a bottom-edge panel\n"
"  -l, --left=PANEL\topen PANEL as a left-edge panel\n"
"  -r, --right=PANEL\topen PANEL as a right-edge panel\n"
"  -t, --top=PANEL\topen PANEL as a top-edge panel\n"
"\n"
"Report bugs to %s.\n"
"Rox-Filer2 continuation: josejp2424\n"
"Original ROX-Filer author: Thomas Leonard\n"
"Project: https://github.com/josejp2424/ROX-Filer-gtk3\n"
msgstr ""
"Us: rox [OPCIO]... [FITXER]...\n"
"El Rox-Filer2 obre cada directori o fitxer indicat, o el directori de\n"
"treball actual si no es donen arguments.\n"
"\n"
"Escriptori:\n"
"      --desktop\tinicia l'unica instancia de l'Escriptori Rox-Filer2\n"
"\n"
"Gestor de fitxers:\n"
"  -c, --client-id=ID\tusat per a la gestio de sessio\n"
"  -d, --dir=DIR\t\tobre DIR com a directori (no com a aplicacio)\n"
"  -D, --close=DIR\ttanca DIR i els seus subdirectoris\n"
"  -h, --help\t\tmostra aquesta ajuda i surt\n"
"  -m, --mime-type=FILE\timprimeix el tipus MIME de FITXER i surt\n"
"  -n, --new\t\tinicia una instancia separada del gestor\n"
"  -R, --RPC\t\tinvoca la crida a metode llegida de l'entrada estandard\n"
"  -s, --show=FILE\tobre un directori mostrant FITXER\n"
"  -u, --user\t\tmostra el nom d'usuari a cada finestra\n"
"  -U, --url=URL\t\tobre fitxer o directori en forma d'URI\n"
"  -v, --version\t\tmostra la versio i surt\n"
"  -x, --examine=FILE\tFITXER ha canviat: torna a examinar-lo\n"
"\n"
"Compatibilitat amb plafons ROX heretats:\n"
"  -b, --border=PANEL\tobre PLAFO com a plafo de vora\n"
"  -B, --bottom=PANEL\tobre PLAFO com a plafo de la vora inferior\n"
"  -l, --left=PANEL\tobre PLAFO com a plafo de la vora esquerra\n"
"  -r, --right=PANEL\tobre PLAFO com a plafo de la vora dreta\n"
"  -t, --top=PANEL\tobre PLAFO com a plafo de la vora superior\n"
"\n"
"Informeu dels errors a %s.\n"
"Continuacio del Rox-Filer2: josejp2424\n"
"Autor del ROX-Filer original: Thomas Leonard\n"
"Projecte: https://github.com/josejp2424/ROX-Filer-gtk3\n"

