"Makes sure panels stay against screen edges. Disable this option if the "
"panel stays above other windows against your wishes. Requires a restart to "
"take effect."
msgstr ""
"Makes sure panels stay against screen edges. Disable this option if the "
"panel stays above other windows against your wishes. Requires a restart to "
"take effect."

msgid "Panel stays on top"
msgstr "Panel stays on top"

