"Keeps the panel above other windows. Enable this option to make sure the "
"dock option works correctly in some versions of compiz. May require a "
"restart to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Keeps the panel above other windows. Enable this option to make sure the "
"dock option works correctly in some versions of compiz. May require a "
"restart to take effect."

